item.title:
[NewsHour]The growing use of artificial intelligence to create sexually explicit images of people without their consent is raising new concerns about privacy, exploitation and the laws meant to protect victims.

Among those calling for greater protections is Paris Hilton, who was on Capitol Hill this week, urging lawmakers to pass the bipartisan DEFIANCE Act.

@ElizLanders has more.

